[[{"s":45,"a":4,"en":"And in the creation of yourselves and what He disperses of moving creatures are signs for people who are certain [in faith].","w":[["وَفِي","And in"],["خَلۡقِكُمۡ","your creation"],["وَمَا","and what"],["يَبُثُّ","He disperses"],["مِن","of"],["دَآبَّةٍ","(the) moving creatures"],["ءَايَٰتٞ","(are) Signs"],["لِّقَوۡمٖ","for a people"],["يُوقِنُونَ","who are certain"]]},{"s":6,"a":66,"en":"But your people have denied it while it is the truth. Say, \"I am not over you a manager.\"","w":[["وَكَذَّبَ","But denied"],["بِهِۦ","it"],["قَوۡمُكَ","your people"],["وَهُوَ","while it"],["ٱلۡحَقُّۚ","(is) the truth"],["قُل","Say"],["لَّسۡتُ","I am not"],["عَلَيۡكُم","over you"],["بِوَكِيلٖ","a manager"]]},{"s":40,"a":41,"en":"And O my people, how is it that I invite you to salvation while you invite me to the Fire?","w":[["۞وَيَٰقَوۡمِ","And O my people"],["مَا","What (is)"],["لِيٓ","for me"],["أَدۡعُوكُمۡ","(that) I call you"],["إِلَى","to"],["ٱلنَّجَوٰةِ","the salvation"],["وَتَدۡعُونَنِيٓ","while you call me"],["إِلَى","to"],["ٱلنَّارِ","the Fire"]]},{"s":25,"a":9,"en":"Look how they strike for you comparisons; but they have strayed, so they cannot [find] a way.","w":[["ٱنظُرۡ","See"],["كَيۡفَ","how"],["ضَرَبُواْ","they set forth"],["لَكَ","for you"],["ٱلۡأَمۡثَٰلَ","the similitudes"],["فَضَلُّواْ","but they have gone astray"],["فَلَا","so not"],["يَسۡتَطِيعُونَ","they are able (to find)"],["سَبِيلٗا","a way"]]}],[{"s":39,"a":13,"en":"Say, \"Indeed I fear, if I should disobey my Lord, the punishment of a tremendous Day.\"","w":[["قُلۡ","Say"],["إِنِّيٓ","Indeed,I"],["أَخَافُ","[I] fear"],["إِنۡ","if"],["عَصَيۡتُ","I disobey"],["رَبِّي","my Lord"],["عَذَابَ","(the) punishment"],["يَوۡمٍ","(of) a Day"],["عَظِيمٖ","great"]]},{"s":43,"a":18,"en":"So is one brought up in ornaments while being during conflict unevident [attributed to Allah]?","w":[["أَوَمَن","Then (is one) who"],["يُنَشَّؤُاْ","is brought up"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡحِلۡيَةِ","ornaments"],["وَهُوَ","and he"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡخِصَامِ","the dispute"],["غَيۡرُ","(is) not"],["مُبِينٖ","clear"]]},{"s":30,"a":15,"en":"And as for those who had believed and done righteous deeds, they will be in a garden [of Paradise], delighted.","w":[["فَأَمَّا","Then as for"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["ءَامَنُواْ","believed"],["وَعَمِلُواْ","and did"],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ","righteous deeds"],["فَهُمۡ","so they"],["فِي","in"],["رَوۡضَةٖ","a Garden"],["يُحۡبَرُونَ","will be delighted"]]},{"s":28,"a":17,"en":"He said, \"My Lord, for the favor You bestowed upon me, I will never be an assistant to the criminals.\"","w":[["قَالَ","He said"],["رَبِّ","My Lord"],["بِمَآ","Because"],["أَنۡعَمۡتَ","You have favored"],["عَلَيَّ","[on] me"],["فَلَنۡ","so not"],["أَكُونَ","I will be"],["ظَهِيرٗا","a supporter"],["لِّلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ","(of) the criminals"]]}],[{"s":11,"a":90,"en":"And ask forgiveness of your Lord and then repent to Him. Indeed, my Lord is Merciful and Affectionate.\"","w":[["وَٱسۡتَغۡفِرُواْ","And ask forgiveness"],["رَبَّكُمۡ","(of) your Lord"],["ثُمَّ","then"],["تُوبُوٓاْ","turn in repentance"],["إِلَيۡهِۚ","to Him"],["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["رَبِّي","my Lord"],["رَحِيمٞ","(is) Most Merciful"],["وَدُودٞ","Most Loving"]]},{"s":37,"a":8,"en":"[So] they may not listen to the exalted assembly [of angels] and are pelted from every side,","w":[["لَّا","Not"],["يَسَّمَّعُونَ","they may listen"],["إِلَى","to"],["ٱلۡمَلَإِ","the assembly"],["ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ","[the] exalted"],["وَيُقۡذَفُونَ","are pelted"],["مِن","from"],["كُلِّ","every"],["جَانِبٖ","side"]]},{"s":49,"a":10,"en":"The believers are but brothers, so make settlement between your brothers. And fear Allah that you may receive mercy.","w":[["إِنَّمَا","Only"],["ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنُونَ","the believers"],["إِخۡوَةٞ","(are) brothers"],["فَأَصۡلِحُواْ","so make peace"],["بَيۡنَ","between"],["أَخَوَيۡكُمۡۚ","your brothers"],["وَٱتَّقُواْ","and fear Allah"],["ٱللَّهَ","and fear Allah"],["لَعَلَّكُمۡ","so that you may"],["تُرۡحَمُونَ","receive mercy"]]},{"s":8,"a":55,"en":"Indeed, the worst of living creatures in the sight of Allah are those who have disbelieved, and they will not [ever] believe -","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["شَرَّ","(the) worst"],["ٱلدَّوَآبِّ","(of) the living creatures"],["عِندَ","near"],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(are) those who"],["كَفَرُواْ","disbelieve"],["فَهُمۡ","and they"],["لَا","(will) not"],["يُؤۡمِنُونَ","believe"]]}],[{"s":8,"a":68,"en":"If not for a decree from Allah that preceded, you would have been touched for what you took by a great punishment.","w":[["لَّوۡلَا","Had not"],["كِتَٰبٞ","an ordainment"],["مِّنَ","from"],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah"],["سَبَقَ","preceded"],["لَمَسَّكُمۡ","surely (would) have touched you"],["فِيمَآ","for what"],["أَخَذۡتُمۡ","you took"],["عَذَابٌ","a punishment"],["عَظِيمٞ","great"]]},{"s":20,"a":64,"en":"So resolve upon your plan and then come [forward] in line. And he has succeeded today who overcomes.\"","w":[["فَأَجۡمِعُواْ","So put together"],["كَيۡدَكُمۡ","your plan"],["ثُمَّ","then"],["ٱئۡتُواْ","come"],["صَفّٗاۚ","(in) a line"],["وَقَدۡ","And verily"],["أَفۡلَحَ","(will be) successful"],["ٱلۡيَوۡمَ","today"],["مَنِ","who"],["ٱسۡتَعۡلَىٰ","overcomes"]]},{"s":18,"a":9,"en":"Or have you thought that the companions of the cave and the inscription were, among Our signs, a wonder?","w":[["أَمۡ","Or"],["حَسِبۡتَ","have you thought"],["أَنَّ","that"],["أَصۡحَٰبَ","(the) companions"],["ٱلۡكَهۡفِ","(of) the cave"],["وَٱلرَّقِيمِ","and the inscription"],["كَانُواْ","were"],["مِنۡ","among"],["ءَايَٰتِنَا","Our Signs"],["عَجَبًا","a wonder"]]},{"s":6,"a":11,"en":"Say, \"Travel through the land; then observe how was the end of the deniers.\"","w":[["قُلۡ","Say"],["سِيرُواْ","Travel"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡأَرۡضِ","the earth"],["ثُمَّ","and"],["ٱنظُرُواْ","see"],["كَيۡفَ","how"],["كَانَ","was"],["عَٰقِبَةُ","(the) end"],["ٱلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","(of) the rejecters"]]}],[{"s":32,"a":7,"en":"Who perfected everything which He created and began the creation of man from clay.","w":[["ٱلَّذِيٓ","The One Who"],["أَحۡسَنَ","made good"],["كُلَّ","every"],["شَيۡءٍ","thing"],["خَلَقَهُۥۖ","He created"],["وَبَدَأَ","and He began"],["خَلۡقَ","(the) creation"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنِ","(of) man"],["مِن","from"],["طِينٖ","clay"]]},{"s":76,"a":2,"en":"Indeed, We created man from a sperm-drop mixture that We may try him; and We made him hearing and seeing.","w":[["إِنَّا","Indeed,We"],["خَلَقۡنَا","[We] created"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","man"],["مِن","from"],["نُّطۡفَةٍ","a semen-drop"],["أَمۡشَاجٖ","a mixture"],["نَّبۡتَلِيهِ","(that) We test him"],["فَجَعَلۡنَٰهُ","so We made (for) him"],["سَمِيعَۢا","hearing"],["بَصِيرًا","and sight"]]},{"s":64,"a":8,"en":"So believe in Allah and His Messenger and the Qur'an which We have sent down. And Allah is Acquainted with what you do.","w":[["فَـَٔامِنُواْ","So believe"],["بِٱللَّهِ","in Allah"],["وَرَسُولِهِۦ","and His Messenger"],["وَٱلنُّورِ","and the Light"],["ٱلَّذِيٓ","which"],["أَنزَلۡنَاۚ","We have sent down"],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah"],["بِمَا","of what"],["تَعۡمَلُونَ","you do"],["خَبِيرٞ","(is) All-Aware"]]},{"s":40,"a":52,"en":"The Day their excuse will not benefit the wrongdoers, and they will have the curse, and they will have the worst home.","w":[["يَوۡمَ","(The) Day"],["لَا","not"],["يَنفَعُ","will benefit"],["ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","the wrongdoers"],["مَعۡذِرَتُهُمۡۖ","their excuse"],["وَلَهُمُ","and for them"],["ٱللَّعۡنَةُ","(is) the curse"],["وَلَهُمۡ","and for them"],["سُوٓءُ","(is the) worst"],["ٱلدَّارِ","home"]]}],[{"s":3,"a":22,"en":"They are the ones whose deeds have become worthless in this world and the Hereafter, and for them there will be no helpers.","w":[["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","Those"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(are) the ones who"],["حَبِطَتۡ","became worthless"],["أَعۡمَٰلُهُمۡ","their deeds"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلدُّنۡيَا","the world"],["وَٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ","and (in) the Hereafter"],["وَمَا","And not"],["لَهُم","(will be) for them"],["مِّن","any"],["نَّـٰصِرِينَ","helpers"]]},{"s":17,"a":72,"en":"And whoever is blind in this [life] will be blind in the Hereafter and more astray in way.","w":[["وَمَن","And whoever"],["كَانَ","is"],["فِي","in"],["هَٰذِهِۦٓ","this (world)"],["أَعۡمَىٰ","blind"],["فَهُوَ","then he"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ","the Hereafter"],["أَعۡمَىٰ","(will be) blind"],["وَأَضَلُّ","and more astray"],["سَبِيلٗا","(from the) path"]]},{"s":30,"a":45,"en":"That He may reward those who have believed and done righteous deeds out of His bounty. Indeed, He does not like the disbelievers.","w":[["لِيَجۡزِيَ","That He may reward"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["ءَامَنُواْ","believe"],["وَعَمِلُواْ","and do"],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ","righteous deeds"],["مِن","(out) of"],["فَضۡلِهِۦٓۚ","His Bounty"],["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed,He"],["لَا","(does) not"],["يُحِبُّ","like"],["ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","the disbelievers"]]},{"s":17,"a":35,"en":"And give full measure when you measure, and weigh with an even balance. That is the best [way] and best in result.","w":[["وَأَوۡفُواْ","And give full"],["ٱلۡكَيۡلَ","[the] measure"],["إِذَا","when"],["كِلۡتُمۡ","you measure"],["وَزِنُواْ","and weigh"],["بِٱلۡقِسۡطَاسِ","with the balance"],["ٱلۡمُسۡتَقِيمِۚ","the straight"],["ذَٰلِكَ","That"],["خَيۡرٞ","(is) good"],["وَأَحۡسَنُ","and best"],["تَأۡوِيلٗا","(in) result"]]}],[{"s":47,"a":11,"en":"That is because Allah is the protector of those who have believed and because the disbelievers have no protector.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That"],["بِأَنَّ","(is) because"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["مَوۡلَى","(is the) Protector"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(of) those who"],["ءَامَنُواْ","believe"],["وَأَنَّ","and that"],["ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","the disbelievers"],["لَا","(there is) no"],["مَوۡلَىٰ","protector"],["لَهُمۡ","for them"]]},{"s":14,"a":25,"en":"It produces its fruit all the time, by permission of its Lord. And Allah presents examples for the people that perhaps they will be reminded.","w":[["تُؤۡتِيٓ","Giving"],["أُكُلَهَا","its fruit"],["كُلَّ","all"],["حِينِۭ","time"],["بِإِذۡنِ","by the permission"],["رَبِّهَاۗ","of its Lord"],["وَيَضۡرِبُ","And Allah sets forth"],["ٱللَّهُ","And Allah sets forth"],["ٱلۡأَمۡثَالَ","the examples"],["لِلنَّاسِ","for mankind"],["لَعَلَّهُمۡ","so that they may"],["يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","remember"]]},{"s":8,"a":33,"en":"But Allah would not punish them while you, [O Muhammad], are among them, and Allah would not punish them while they seek forgiveness.","w":[["وَمَا","But not"],["كَانَ","is"],["ٱللَّهُ","(for) Allah"],["لِيُعَذِّبَهُمۡ","that He punishes them"],["وَأَنتَ","while you"],["فِيهِمۡۚ","(are) among them"],["وَمَا","and not"],["كَانَ","is"],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah"],["مُعَذِّبَهُمۡ","the One Who punishes them"],["وَهُمۡ","while they"],["يَسۡتَغۡفِرُونَ","seek forgiveness"]]},{"s":27,"a":43,"en":"And that which she was worshipping other than Allah had averted her [from submission to Him]. Indeed, she was from a disbelieving people.\"","w":[["وَصَدَّهَا","And has averted her"],["مَا","what"],["كَانَت","she used (to)"],["تَّعۡبُدُ","worship"],["مِن","besides"],["دُونِ","besides"],["ٱللَّهِۖ","Allah"],["إِنَّهَا","Indeed,she"],["كَانَتۡ","was"],["مِن","from"],["قَوۡمٖ","a people"],["كَٰفِرِينَ","who disbelieve"]]}],[{"s":71,"a":25,"en":"Because of their sins they were drowned and put into the Fire, and they found not for themselves besides Allah [any] helpers.","w":[["مِّمَّا","Because of"],["خَطِيٓـَٰٔتِهِمۡ","their sins"],["أُغۡرِقُواْ","they were drowned"],["فَأُدۡخِلُواْ","then made to enter"],["نَارٗا","(the) Fire"],["فَلَمۡ","and not"],["يَجِدُواْ","they found"],["لَهُم","for themselves"],["مِّن","from"],["دُونِ","besides"],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah"],["أَنصَارٗا","any helpers"]]},{"s":30,"a":4,"en":"Within three to nine years. To Allah belongs the command before and after. And that day the believers will rejoice","w":[["فِي","Within"],["بِضۡعِ","a few"],["سِنِينَۗ","years"],["لِلَّهِ","For Allah"],["ٱلۡأَمۡرُ","(is) the command"],["مِن","before"],["قَبۡلُ","before"],["وَمِنۢ","and after"],["بَعۡدُۚ","and after"],["وَيَوۡمَئِذٖ","And that day"],["يَفۡرَحُ","will rejoice"],["ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنُونَ","the believers"]]},{"s":57,"a":18,"en":"Indeed, the men who practice charity and the women who practice charity and [they who] have loaned Allah a goodly loan - it will be multiplied for them, and they will have a noble reward.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلۡمُصَّدِّقِينَ","the men who give charity"],["وَٱلۡمُصَّدِّقَٰتِ","and the women who give charity"],["وَأَقۡرَضُواْ","and who lend"],["ٱللَّهَ","(to) Allah"],["قَرۡضًا","a loan"],["حَسَنٗا","goodly"],["يُضَٰعَفُ","it will be multiplied"],["لَهُمۡ","for them"],["وَلَهُمۡ","and for them"],["أَجۡرٞ","(is) a reward"],["كَرِيمٞ","noble"]]},{"s":6,"a":120,"en":"And leave what is apparent of sin and what is concealed thereof. Indeed, those who earn [blame for] sin will be recompensed for that which they used to commit.","w":[["وَذَرُواْ","Forsake"],["ظَٰهِرَ","open"],["ٱلۡإِثۡمِ","[the] sins"],["وَبَاطِنَهُۥٓۚ","and the secret"],["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["يَكۡسِبُونَ","earn"],["ٱلۡإِثۡمَ","[the] sin"],["سَيُجۡزَوۡنَ","they will be recompensed"],["بِمَا","for what"],["كَانُواْ","they used to"],["يَقۡتَرِفُونَ","commit"]]}]]